<div class="row mb-4">
    <div class="col-12">
        <nav aria-label="breadcrumb">
            <ol class="breadcrumb">
                <li class="breadcrumb-item"><a href="/">Home</a></li>
                <li class="breadcrumb-item"><a href="/erp">ERP</a></li>
                <li class="breadcrumb-item active">Reporting</li>
            </ol>
        </nav>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h1 class="display-4 fw-bold mb-3">ERP Reporting & Comparative Analytics</h1>
        <p class="lead mb-4">
            Authoritative financial and operational intelligence that transforms raw system data into clear, 
            actionable guidance for every organizational level.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">IFRS-Compliant Financial Excellence</h2>
        <p>
            Generate authoritative financial statements (Income Statement, Balance Sheet, Cash Flow) with 
            absolute confidence. The reporting engine ensures that every figure is underpinned 
            by a verifiable audit trail from the General Ledger. Multi-level consolidation 
            support provides group-level statements while allowing for seamless drilldown 
            into the performance of individual business units and cost centers.
        </p>
        <p>
            Automated Management Account Packs consolidate financial results with key 
            operational metrics (e.g., margins by product line, sales rep productivity), 
            providing a holistic view of periodic organizational performance.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">Custom Reporting Flexibility</h2>
        <p>
            Build exactly the reports your business requires with our flexible query and reporting 
            tools. Access any data point from across the ERP—from inventory turnover rates and 
            procurement effectiveness to project profitability and customer lifetime value. 
            Standardize your reporting across departments to ensure everyone is working with 
            the same definition of success.
        </p>
        <p>
            Scheduled report delivery via email or integrated messaging ensures that 
            stakeholders receive their critical performance data automatically, without 
            needing to manually extract information from the system.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">Business Intelligence and Interactivity</h2>
        <p>
            Move beyond static PDF reports to interactive data exploration. Dynamic drilldown 
            capabilities allow users to move from high-level summaries directly to the 
            source transactions, facilitating rapid investigative analysis. For complex data 
            modeling and visualization, Pindah ERP provides native API connectivity to 
            market-leading BI tools like Power BI and Tableau.
        </p>
        <p>
            Role-based visibility ensures that managers only see the data relevant to 
            their scope of responsibility, maintaining data security while empowering 
            decentralized decision-making.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row">
